Cell["\<\
Posterior medians and 95% intervals under five scenarios: baseline, halved \
selection priors, doubled migration prior, and dairying onsets shifted \
\[PlusMinus]400 years. The dairying-modulated selection component stays \
positive throughout (medians 0.008\[Dash]0.019). The migration posterior \
tracks its prior (median 0.010 baseline \[RightArrow] 0.020 under the widened \
prior): with 84 cells and aggregated summaries, movement is weakly \
identified, and the pipeline says so rather than dressing a prior up as a \
finding.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"886afee8-9793-4172-bf64-265a28d76e96"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["9. What this is not", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6d92770c-2e0f-4f3e-a62a-892180a6a771"],

Cell["\<\
The regional logistic layer is a qualitative reproduction of the published \
four-region picture, not a parameter-for-parameter replication of Evershed et \
al.'s analysis. The spatial model is a coarse caricature with implicit \
demography and a deterministic core; the final ESS is modest; and everything \
after ~2,000 BP extrapolates beyond the ancient data. Obvious next steps: a \
stochastic (Wright\[Dash]Fisher noise) simulator, ancestry-aware likelihoods \
at the sample level, an SMC sampler with MCMC rejuvenation moves to fight \
weight degeneracy, and radiocarbon-calibrated date uncertainty propagated \
into the bins.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"3b59a9b0-5f79-4ef0-9a2d-0d80161b69da"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["10. Reproducibility", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"07425389-99fd-4695-95b9-dbd0bc19989b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Everything \[LongDash] retrieval, processing, fits, SMC-ABC, validation, \
sensitivity, maps, animation, and this notebook \[LongDash] is generated by \
the repository at ",
 StyleBox["mthiel74/ancient-dna-lactase-spatial-wolfram",
  FontWeight->"SemiBold"],
 " (",
 StyleBox["https://github.com/mthiel74/ancient-dna-lactase-spatial-wolfram",
  FontFamily->"Courier",
  FontSize->10],
 ")",
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"b70b137c-9ada-4ec7-8984-4ab927abd784"],

Cell["\<\
wolframscript -file scripts/retrieve_data.wls
wolframscript -file scripts/run_pipeline.wls --particles 400 --generations 5
wolframscript -file scripts/run_tests.wls
wolframscript -file community/build_notebook.wls\
\>", "Program",
 CellMargins->{{60, 30}, {6, 6}},
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->11,
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.95, 0.96, 0.98],ExpressionUUID->"4e9e1faf-948c-46b5-946b-d2d7cb68ea6d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The package ",
 StyleBox["src/LactasePersistenceSpatial.wl",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 " (~1,700 lines) exposes the full workflow; ",
 StyleBox["notebooks/LactasePersistenceSpatial.nb",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 " walks the same pipeline interactively; 24 VerificationTests cover parsing, \
the simulator, the summary statistics, and the SMC machinery, and GitHub \
Actions runs them non-interactively. Raw data are preserved read-only with \
checksums; every processed table carries provenance."
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"7541c2ed-c50d-48c2-a4c0-b7c24347de00"]
}, Open  ]],

